cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Math Modeling Viz in your research or competition paper, please cite it."
title: Math Modeling Viz
abstract: >-
  A Python library that generates publication-quality figures for
  mathematical modeling competitions (CUMCM, MCM, ICM) and academic
  papers. Provides 70+ chart types, curated color palettes, journal
  style presets, smart chart auto-detection, and multi-panel composite
  figures through a universal plot() interface.
authors:
  - name: Math Modeling Viz Contributors
version: 10.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-02"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/shipnebula/Modeling_Drawing_Skill"
keywords:
  - mathematical-modeling
  - data-visualization
  - matplotlib
  - publication-quality
  - CUMCM
  - MCM
  - ICM
